      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEIRS ADJOURNED (3) stuck on well last time to finish 0.8 lengths back in third (18.97) at this track in a Maiden over 318m. Can go on with it. SHAKE IT (2) steps out at this track for the first time after an average run at the latest appearance, finishing fifth at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Tuko (17.69). Better than last start and can bounce back. BOGAN BEAST (1) out of the placings last few but draws down on the inside. Last time finished 5th in a Maiden on October 31 over 318m at this track behind Orana Katana beaten 4.5 lengths (19.21). Expected to give a good account. PRETZEL KEEPING (5) has been in the placings at her last two runs, most recently when second (20.67) in a Maiden over 340m at Gunnedah.",
